{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "https://excalidraw.com", "elements": [{"id": "el-0001", "type": "text", "x": 28, "y": 12, "width": 866.2500000000001, "height": 26.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1000, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1007, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1751900000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Tracing across the two-DC fabric: a service (L1 to L7) and a MAC (L1 to L2)", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Tracing across the two-DC fabric: a service (L1 to L7) and a MAC (L1 to L2)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el-0002", "type": "text", "x": 28, "y": 44, "width": 1161.875, "height": 15.625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1014, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1021, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1751900000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The pod network (Cilium VXLAN) rides on the data-center fabric (Cumulus EVPN VXLAN), which rides on a plain routed underlay. Redundancy at every hop: dual-homing + ECMP.", "fontSize": 12.5, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "The pod network (Cilium VXLAN) rides on the data-center fabric (Cumulus EVPN VXLAN), which rides on a plain routed underlay. Redundancy at every hop: dual-homing + ECMP.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el-0003", "type": "text", "x": 28, "y": 84, "width": 1086.8000000000002, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1028, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1035, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1751900000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "TRACE B   service 192.168.202.2 (DC2 dc-demo VIP), followed DC1 to DC2   \u00b7   command at each hop:  vtysh -c \"show ip route vrf tenant-k8s 192.168.202.2\"", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "TRACE B   service 192.168.202.2 (DC2 dc-demo VIP), followed DC1 to DC2   \u00b7   command at each hop:  vtysh -c \"show ip route vrf tenant-k8s 192.168.202.2\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el-0004", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 120, "width": 264.0, "height": 15.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1042, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1049, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1751900000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "DC1  \u00b7  VXLAN overlay on routed underlay", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "DC1  \u00b7  VXLAN overlay on routed underlay", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el-0005", "type": "text", "x": 560, "y": 120, "width": 145.20000000000002, "height": 15.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1056, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1063, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1751900000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "BACKBONE  \u00b7  routed L3", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "BACKBONE  \u00b7  routed L3", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el-0006", "type": "text", "x": 890, "y": 120, "width": 211.20000000000002, "height": 15.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1070, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1077, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1751900000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "DC2  \u00b7  VXLAN overlay + underlay", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "DC2  \u00b7  VXLAN overlay + underlay", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el-0007", "type": "text", "x": 1300, "y": 120, "width": 66.0, "height": 15.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9c36b5", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1084, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1091, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1751900000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "KUBERNETES", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "KUBERNETES", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el-0008", "type": "text", "x": 94.95, "y": 176, "width": 12.100000000000001, "height": 13.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1098, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1105, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updat